WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.120
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.220 --> 00:01.880
Why is it so complicated and mysterious?

3
00:01.880 --> 00:05.490
It'd be great if the mysterious earbuds could answer everything we want to know.

4
00:05.490 --> 00:07.200
What else did you take from Anda's car?

5
00:07.200 --> 00:08.210
These earbuds, too?

6
00:08.210 --> 00:11.970
I thought they might be worth something, so I took them, too.

7
00:11.970 --> 00:13.710
I'm not seeing things, am I?

8
00:13.710 --> 00:14.870
How do they know each other?

9
00:14.870 --> 00:17.090
I'm fine. I was just sleeping.

10
00:17.090 --> 00:18.560
I've been working from home.

11
00:18.560 --> 00:20.320
Should we take this more seriously?

12
00:20.320 --> 00:22.293
Fine, let's do it then.

13
00:22.985 --> 00:24.440
You haven't slept with Jinna yet, have you?

14
00:24.440 --> 00:25.640
What kind of question is that?

15
00:25.640 --> 00:27.000
Sometimes I wonder...

16
00:27.000 --> 00:28.800
what the hell I've gotten myself into.

17
00:28.800 --> 00:29.680
Guess what?

18
00:29.680 --> 00:32.610
If you modify a car by installing a control unit,

19
00:32.610 --> 00:34.430
it basically becomes a magic remote.

20
00:34.430 --> 00:35.610
I've been thinking about it, too.

21
00:35.610 --> 00:36.860
This could be how he was killed.

22
00:36.860 --> 00:39.500
I know you're stressing over what happened to Anda,

23
00:39.500 --> 00:40.620
but I promise...

24
00:40.620 --> 00:42.130
that no matter what happens,

25
00:42.130 --> 00:44.260
I'll always be here for you.

26
01:12.320 --> 01:13.359
Where are you going?

27
01:15.880 --> 01:17.200
Hey.

28
01:17.200 --> 01:20.410
Are you running away now that you've slept with me?

29
01:20.410 --> 01:23.199
No way! Where have you been anyway?

30
01:24.560 --> 01:27.713
And why are you naked?

31
01:28.440 --> 01:30.133
I just went for a run.

32
01:32.080 --> 01:33.406
You're so fit?

33
01:34.610 --> 01:36.306
Do you like it?

34
01:39.070 --> 01:40.800
I'm not messing around this time.

35
02:02.920 --> 02:03.920
What?

36
02:05.500 --> 02:06.720
What are you thinking?

37
02:08.720 --> 02:10.280
Are you teasing me?

38
02:12.320 --> 02:13.700
What do you mean?

39
02:14.340 --> 02:16.260
You're just imagining things.

40
02:27.860 --> 02:29.420
Where are you going, babe?

41
02:29.420 --> 02:31.980
Babe, my ass. I'm going to take a shower.

42
02:34.370 --> 02:36.910
Perfect. Let's shower together.

43
05:23.410 --> 05:25.890
So, how was it for you two?

44
05:25.890 --> 05:27.820
Everything was fine.

45
05:27.820 --> 05:31.800
I slept in my room, and Jinna slept on the couch.

46
05:31.800 --> 05:36.800
Right. I slept on the couch, and Podduang slept in his room.

47
05:40.070 --> 05:44.700
Based on probability theory, when two people--

48
05:44.700 --> 05:46.346
Just eat, Tod.

49
05:46.950 --> 05:48.510
We all already know.

50
05:49.250 --> 05:50.760
Except you.

51
06:04.280 --> 06:07.946
This is the first time we get to come here with you guys.

52
06:09.520 --> 06:11.266
Unfortunately, Anda isn't here.

53
06:17.630 --> 06:18.946
It won't be long now.

54
06:20.240 --> 06:21.846
I'm sure...

55
06:23.380 --> 06:25.859
that Anda will get the justice he deserves.

56
06:31.600 --> 06:33.173
It wasn't Itti,

57
06:33.910 --> 06:36.560
Kum, or the security guard.

58
06:36.560 --> 06:38.613
We can't rule out the security guard yet.

59
06:39.240 --> 06:41.408
I still think he's suspicious.

60
06:41.408 --> 06:43.770
What if there's more to this than we thought?

61
06:43.770 --> 06:46.120
There might be more than one killer.

62
06:47.760 --> 06:48.880
Podduang.

63
06:48.880 --> 06:53.233
You know, Anda was always targeted by haters.

64
06:53.233 --> 06:55.920
There's this one account that's been stirring up all the hate.

65
06:55.920 --> 06:58.920
Don't you think it's strange that the account hasn't said anything?

66
06:58.920 --> 07:00.293
It just disappeared.

67
07:01.360 --> 07:04.153
[The Chemistry is Real! Fans Show Up in Force to Welcome Them on Day One]

68
07:04.960 --> 07:07.786
It could be the same person who sent him the bloodstained doll.

69
07:09.940 --> 07:12.333
That's another possibility on the table.

70
07:13.640 --> 07:16.770
Dunk and I will handle this.

71
07:16.770 --> 07:20.340
Art and I will look into the laptop and phone.

72
07:23.170 --> 07:24.773
Podduang and I will see...

73
07:26.680 --> 07:28.266
what we can find out from these.

74
07:35.580 --> 07:36.912
[Breaking News]

75
07:43.240 --> 07:47.086
[(Fake) Andaman: If you won't leave the showbiz, then go to hell already!]

76
07:52.590 --> 07:56.730
[Characters, places, and incidents in this production]

77
07:56.730 --> 07:58.432
[are entirely fictitious.]

78
07:58.432 --> 08:00.510
[Viewer discretion is advised.]

79
09:19.680 --> 09:24.460
Jinna, it's going to be tough finding the laptop and phone.

80
09:24.460 --> 09:27.470
I've checked every service center, and there's no trace of them.

81
09:27.470 --> 09:30.340
I've also checked every shop.

82
09:30.340 --> 09:31.773
Nothing here, either.

83
09:34.550 --> 09:38.286
So what if the security guard lied to us?

84
09:40.180 --> 09:42.640
The laptop and phone might be with the killer.

85
09:42.640 --> 09:44.066
Is that possible?

86
09:44.860 --> 09:49.460
About Kum's leaked chat, if it wasn't the killer, then who was it?

87
09:49.460 --> 09:51.910
Could it have been the buyer?

88
09:51.910 --> 09:54.320
Why would they care about that stuff?

89
09:54.320 --> 09:57.720
They'd just wipe the data and use the devices for themselves.

90
09:57.720 --> 09:59.266
That means...

91
10:00.030 --> 10:04.846
there must be something on Anda's phone and laptop.

92
10:08.020 --> 10:10.700
We shouldn't lose hope just yet.

93
10:10.700 --> 10:14.600
I'll ask the professor about Anda's car.

94
10:14.600 --> 10:16.293
I think I'll talk to the police.

95
10:17.300 --> 10:20.010
They might be able to track the signals from the laptop and phone.

96
10:20.010 --> 10:21.530
The police?

97
10:21.530 --> 10:23.590
They're slower than the college's free Wi-Fi.

98
10:23.590 --> 10:29.376
Just you wait. They'll just say, "Why don't you leave this to us, kids?"

99
10:30.530 --> 10:33.760
I'm not going down for this. You're on your own.

100
10:34.760 --> 10:37.140
You really let the police have it.

101
10:39.680 --> 10:43.130
[Anda was definitely murdered.]

102
10:43.130 --> 10:46.780
[The person who took his phone is the most suspicious! #WhatHappenedToAnda]

103
10:46.780 --> 10:50.360
[Where did that account go? That little brat. #Anda #Andashock #FakeAnda]

104
10:50.360 --> 10:53.840
[I really want to see that hater's face. They must be loving this.]

105
10:54.660 --> 10:58.340
[Anda might have actually taken his life, you guys...]

106
10:58.340 --> 11:02.480
[Calm down. People get stressed and can end up making a bad decision. #Anda]

107
11:02.480 --> 11:04.360
[Mind your own business!]

108
11:07.900 --> 11:09.740
You look so grumpy.

109
11:12.260 --> 11:14.560
The comments are just people running their mouths.

110
11:14.560 --> 11:16.320
Reading them only makes it worse.

111
11:19.880 --> 11:22.800
Well, have you heard Anda's voice lately?

112
11:28.570 --> 11:30.060
Not really.

113
11:31.664 --> 11:33.240
Sometimes I do, sometimes I don't.

114
11:36.186 --> 11:40.784
I hope Anda will hear us talking, right?

115
11:45.920 --> 11:47.560
Anda.

116
11:49.040 --> 11:51.430
How are you doing?

117
11:51.430 --> 11:53.700
I miss you, man!

118
11:55.410 --> 11:56.720
You didn't have to yell.

119
11:56.720 --> 11:58.140
You could've made me go deaf.

120
11:59.910 --> 12:01.110
I missed you.

121
12:01.110 --> 12:02.613
That's for you.

122
12:03.220 --> 12:04.830
Jeez.

123
12:04.830 --> 12:06.273
That's enough.

124
12:07.060 --> 12:09.720
Where are you going next?

125
12:10.866 --> 12:12.750
Probably the police station.

126
12:14.360 --> 12:19.160
I'm going to talk to the police about the laptop, the phone, and these earbuds.

127
12:19.160 --> 12:20.940
Maybe they can help.

128
12:21.660 --> 12:23.330
Want to come?

129
12:23.330 --> 12:24.533
Yeah.

130
12:26.640 --> 12:28.890
Don't give them to the police or anyone.

131
12:28.890 --> 12:30.266
Wait, Jinna.

132
12:33.750 --> 12:35.326
Anda told me...

133
12:37.200 --> 12:38.826
not to give them to the police.

134
12:47.680 --> 12:51.710
Bum, can people really hate someone they don't even know so much

135
12:51.710 --> 12:54.120
that they'd actually kill them?

136
12:54.120 --> 12:57.340
These people are scarier than you can imagine.

137
12:57.340 --> 13:00.160
Jeez, take a break, Miss Detective.

138
13:00.160 --> 13:01.880
Eat something.

139
13:02.800 --> 13:03.920
[(Fake) Andaman: Anda's acting is terrible.]

140
13:03.920 --> 13:05.213
[Only James should be in the frame. Anda shouldn't have shown his face.]

141
13:08.700 --> 13:10.300
Wait.

142
13:10.300 --> 13:12.560
You're trying to crack this account's password?

143
13:12.560 --> 13:13.740
Yeah.

144
13:13.740 --> 13:15.680
Stop talking and help me.

145
13:15.680 --> 13:16.790
Are you crazy?

146
13:16.790 --> 13:20.020
You could spend the rest of your life guessing and still not get it right.

147
13:20.020 --> 13:23.033
Jeez, you know nothing.

148
13:24.596 --> 13:26.280
"Emma."

149
13:26.280 --> 13:27.750
Who?

150
13:27.750 --> 13:28.960
I don't know.

151
13:28.960 --> 13:32.633
I'll use the email to see what accounts it's linked to.

152
13:36.280 --> 13:39.600
It's linked to a Facebook account that was created 14 years ago.

153
13:39.600 --> 13:41.660
It was a Hotmail address.

154
13:41.660 --> 13:44.760
Wait, you can dig up stuff from over a decade ago?

155
13:45.340 --> 13:48.540
These people usually have old accounts from their school days.

156
13:48.540 --> 13:52.666
Once they get older, they'll try to start fresh by creating new email addresses.

157
13:53.840 --> 13:56.080
To be fair, I used to have one, too.

158
13:56.080 --> 14:00.366
It was "dunk007@hotmail.com."

159
14:01.200 --> 14:02.760
Cool, right?

160
14:02.760 --> 14:04.646
It's so outdated.

161
14:10.200 --> 14:12.166
[Onnicha Udomchok]

162
14:15.600 --> 14:17.853
It must be one of these five people.

163
14:24.600 --> 14:25.726
Podduang.

164
14:26.870 --> 14:28.240
Hey, Podduang.

165
14:32.880 --> 14:34.960
Why are you spacing out?

166
14:34.960 --> 14:36.346
Podduang.

167
14:37.808 --> 14:39.073
Podduang.

168
14:49.710 --> 14:51.180
Podduang.

169
14:52.650 --> 14:54.260
Podduang...

170
14:54.260 --> 14:56.360
Podduang, what happened to your lips?

171
14:56.360 --> 14:58.680
What? Nothing.

172
14:58.680 --> 15:00.086
Then why were you doing this?

173
15:02.750 --> 15:04.720
My lips are just itchy.

174
15:04.720 --> 15:09.280
Don't tell me you and Jinna...

175
15:15.240 --> 15:16.840
You're getting on my nerves.

176
15:18.940 --> 15:20.820
Fine, I'll believe you.

177
15:23.490 --> 15:24.960
Let me tell you something.

178
15:27.450 --> 15:29.010
Wrong way.

179
15:29.010 --> 15:30.340
Thank me later.

180
15:33.504 --> 15:34.920
You must have done it already.

181
15:34.920 --> 15:36.660
Satang!

182
15:36.660 --> 15:38.336
Stop.

183
15:38.336 --> 15:39.600
No.

184
15:39.600 --> 15:42.160
I was kidding. It was a joke.

185
15:48.750 --> 15:50.870
Are you coming with me or what?

186
15:50.870 --> 15:52.420
Isn't Jinna picking you up?

187
15:52.420 --> 15:53.730
You're pushing it, aren't you?

188
15:53.730 --> 15:55.040
I'm coming with you.

189
15:55.040 --> 15:57.380
Wait, I forgot my phone.

190
15:57.380 --> 15:58.666
Just a sec.

191
16:00.320 --> 16:01.480
- It won't be long. - I'll wait here.

192
16:01.480 --> 16:02.653
Okay.

193
16:21.000 --> 16:22.680
Hey, Amp...

194
16:25.640 --> 16:27.310
Are you okay?

195
16:34.840 --> 16:36.899
Is something wrong?

196
16:43.840 --> 16:44.913
Let's go.

197
16:47.310 --> 16:49.100
Is something wrong?

198
16:49.100 --> 16:50.960
No. Let's just go.

199
16:53.240 --> 16:54.840
I already asked the professor.

200
16:54.840 --> 16:56.993
Something is definitely off.

201
16:57.984 --> 16:59.120
Right.

202
16:59.120 --> 17:02.710
Even someone who's not an auto expert would know something's off.

203
17:06.080 --> 17:07.620
How's it going?

204
17:09.810 --> 17:12.830
Jinna, something is definitely off.

205
17:12.830 --> 17:18.080
First, there's no way Anda would've let himself suffocate in that car.

206
17:18.080 --> 17:21.980
Second, this car model has tons of sensors.

207
17:21.980 --> 17:24.840
It wouldn't just let its driver die inside.

208
17:24.840 --> 17:28.590
Exactly. Normally, if the carbon dioxide levels exceed a certain threshold,

209
17:28.590 --> 17:31.200
the system should pull in fresh air, right?

210
17:31.200 --> 17:34.800
At the very least, it should've sent a notification to the owner's phone.

211
17:35.870 --> 17:41.920
Could the ECU have been tampered with before the police arrived?

212
17:41.920 --> 17:45.250
Are you saying the car was hacked?

213
17:48.280 --> 17:52.200
Meaning, if it was hacked,

214
17:52.200 --> 17:54.553
they would've been able to control the whole CAN bus.

215
17:54.553 --> 17:55.720
Exactly.

216
17:55.720 --> 17:59.170
Usually, these cars come with an automatic ventilation system.

217
17:59.170 --> 18:04.766
If it detects low oxygen levels in the car, it notifies you immediately.

218
18:05.720 --> 18:07.120
However,

219
18:07.800 --> 18:10.310
if someone else controlled it

220
18:14.190 --> 18:18.920
and forced the valves and motors to shut down, it'd be game over.

221
18:19.780 --> 18:21.770
That's pretty damn likely.

222
18:22.460 --> 18:26.613
What about the lab results for the medication Anda took regularly?

223
18:27.690 --> 18:30.679
Could it be that someone made him take pills?

224
18:32.980 --> 18:34.950
Or drugged him.

225
18:34.950 --> 18:36.520
Shit.

226
18:37.640 --> 18:39.960
These cars are built to be smart,

227
18:39.960 --> 18:42.910
but they become high-tech death traps

228
18:42.910 --> 18:46.253
when someone else takes control of the software.

229
19:20.450 --> 19:21.790
No need to be shy.

230
19:21.790 --> 19:23.710
Feel free to flirt as much as you want.

231
19:23.710 --> 19:26.000
Tod and I are heading to our faculty.

232
19:26.000 --> 19:28.050
Me? When did I...

233
19:28.050 --> 19:30.233
- I just got back from the faculty. - Go!

234
19:31.824 --> 19:33.266
Isn't it too close?

235
19:34.360 --> 19:36.760
I want to look at you up close.

236
19:36.760 --> 19:37.986
Can't I?

237
19:40.040 --> 19:42.080
What's with you?

238
19:42.930 --> 19:45.240
Why do you sound so stern when you're blushing?

239
19:47.580 --> 19:51.540
You know that makes me blush, so why do you keep teasing me?

240
19:51.540 --> 19:53.060
Go away.

241
19:54.390 --> 19:56.040
I'm not teasing.

242
19:56.820 --> 19:59.120
I already told you that night at the beach...

243
20:00.224 --> 20:01.813
that I'm not messing around.

244
20:07.410 --> 20:09.440
So this is how they do it, huh?

245
20:09.440 --> 20:11.000
What do you mean?

246
20:13.180 --> 20:17.159
You know, how soccer players flirt.

247
20:18.490 --> 20:20.360
No wonder...

248
20:20.360 --> 20:26.360
the girls fall head over heels.

249
20:26.360 --> 20:27.720
Are you jealous?

250
20:31.440 --> 20:33.633
If you're jealous, then be my boyfriend

251
20:34.340 --> 20:36.533
so they can be jealous of you instead.

252
20:44.080 --> 20:49.968
You know sports science and engineering can't stand each other.

253
20:53.190 --> 20:54.980
That means...

254
20:55.760 --> 20:58.080
you're not saying no, right?

255
20:59.286 --> 21:00.736
What?

256
21:02.220 --> 21:04.406
Don't want to date an engineering student?

257
21:07.400 --> 21:08.816
No.

258
21:11.280 --> 21:13.253
Then how about dating a soccer player?

259
21:21.920 --> 21:23.200
Pass the ball.

260
21:35.580 --> 21:37.840
How do you end up drenched just from drinking water?

261
21:37.840 --> 21:40.746
Well, it's hot.

262
21:43.010 --> 21:45.053
Go take a shower.

263
21:48.660 --> 21:50.128
What's wrong?

264
21:51.580 --> 21:53.026
My wrist hurts.

265
21:53.800 --> 21:55.952
I guess I can't shower by myself anymore.

266
21:56.656 --> 21:58.373
Do you want to get hurt for real?

267
21:59.200 --> 22:01.666
Damn, someone's got a temper.

268
22:07.920 --> 22:10.610
So, how is it on your end?

269
22:10.610 --> 22:12.346
Found anything suspicious?

270
22:14.400 --> 22:16.313
It seems Anda's car was hacked.

271
22:18.080 --> 22:19.960
The more I think about it,

272
22:20.640 --> 22:22.380
the more I feel sorry for him.

273
22:24.680 --> 22:26.740
What did he do to deserve this?

274
22:31.420 --> 22:34.313
Not to mention the CCTV being broken at that exact spot.

275
22:37.106 --> 22:39.662
What did the condo staff say?

276
22:39.662 --> 22:40.846
Do you know?

277
22:42.740 --> 22:44.073
I don't.

278
22:47.250 --> 22:49.726
We'll find the killer no matter what.

279
23:08.600 --> 23:09.780
Podduang.

280
23:12.120 --> 23:14.080
I have a scholarship ceremony tomorrow.

281
23:16.832 --> 23:17.986
Please come.

282
23:22.560 --> 23:23.593
Okay.

283
23:39.580 --> 23:44.790
I practiced soccer, showered, went out to eat, came back to watch a movie,

284
23:44.790 --> 23:47.566
and played games, but you're still in the same spot.

285
23:51.010 --> 23:52.420
- Babe. - Yeah?

286
23:52.420 --> 23:53.773
Come here.

287
24:08.950 --> 24:10.848
Everyone in this photo is friends.

288
24:10.848 --> 24:12.240
They're all the same age.

289
24:12.240 --> 24:16.120
The first one is Nam Kanyarat, a doctor.

290
24:16.120 --> 24:19.640
The second one is Cha-em. Used to be a flight attendant. Now married.

291
24:19.640 --> 24:22.770
The third one is Nan. She's already passed away.

292
24:22.770 --> 24:24.440
Skip that one.

293
24:24.440 --> 24:29.520
The fourth one is now a butch named Bew, who is an insurance agent.

294
24:29.520 --> 24:34.410
The last one is a voice teacher named Toey, but she's been abroad for three months now.

295
24:34.410 --> 24:36.150
She hasn't come back at all.

296
24:36.150 --> 24:40.920
So you're asking me who is the most likely person to have killed Anda?

297
24:40.920 --> 24:42.080
Yes.

298
24:42.080 --> 24:44.260
How would I know?

299
24:44.885 --> 24:46.480
Maybe Cha-em?

300
24:46.480 --> 24:49.470
Her name sounds kinda like Emma.

301
24:49.470 --> 24:51.650
Maybe she went to study abroad,

302
24:51.650 --> 24:54.780
and to make her name easier to pronounce, she became Emma.

303
24:54.780 --> 24:58.370
That sounds plausible, but it's not her.

304
24:58.370 --> 25:03.386
I suspected her the most, too, but after digging deeper,

305
25:04.140 --> 25:06.450
there was nothing suspicious at all.

306
25:06.450 --> 25:08.800
Honestly, look,

307
25:09.590 --> 25:11.180
I'm starting to suspect you now.

308
25:11.180 --> 25:13.150
How did you get all this information?

309
25:13.150 --> 25:16.310
This is where haters wage their wars.

310
25:16.880 --> 25:18.210
That's scary.

311
25:18.210 --> 25:20.250
I'm afraid to do anything wrong now.

312
25:21.780 --> 25:24.180
You're not even supposed to think about doing it.

313
25:25.120 --> 25:26.606
My apologies.

314
25:27.210 --> 25:30.760
Anyway, if it's not one of these five people,

315
25:30.760 --> 25:32.793
that just leaves the person who took the photo.

316
25:34.600 --> 25:35.620
What?

317
25:37.040 --> 25:39.392
- What? - You're so smart.

318
25:39.392 --> 25:40.566
What?

319
25:47.720 --> 25:50.480
[Certificate Presentation Ceremony for Outstanding Scholarship Students]

320
25:50.480 --> 25:51.480
[Special Program, 2026]

321
25:59.280 --> 26:01.000
Who are you looking for?

322
26:02.680 --> 26:03.686
Well...

323
26:04.450 --> 26:06.586
I actually invited Podduang to come along.

324
26:08.960 --> 26:12.960
All right, scholarship students. Let's get a group photo right here.

325
26:12.960 --> 26:13.960
Come, everyone.

326
26:13.960 --> 26:17.820
Okay. Group photo, everyone. Please move closer together.

327
26:17.820 --> 26:20.370
Okay. One, two, three!

328
26:21.540 --> 26:24.920
Okay. Smile. One, two, three!

329
26:24.920 --> 26:26.200
Thank you.

330
26:26.200 --> 26:27.872
Thank you.

331
26:27.872 --> 26:29.010
Thank you.

332
26:29.010 --> 26:30.880
Wait, Risa and Jinna.

333
26:30.880 --> 26:35.220
Let's get a photo of you two. I'll post it to promote our college.

334
26:35.220 --> 26:38.270
- Come on, the two of you. - Move to the center, please. Good.

335
26:38.270 --> 26:39.790
- Excellent. - A bit more to the left.

336
26:39.790 --> 26:44.050
Good. One, two, three.

337
26:44.050 --> 26:45.480
Okay.

338
26:45.480 --> 26:47.480
Smile. One, two...

339
26:47.480 --> 26:50.320
That's my friend.

340
26:50.320 --> 26:53.000
Relax, man. Take it easy.

341
26:54.120 --> 26:55.570
Three!

342
26:56.240 --> 26:59.970
Do you want to grab some food together after this?

343
27:01.660 --> 27:03.293
I already have plans.

344
27:04.920 --> 27:07.280
You're going to celebrate with Tod and Art?

345
27:13.750 --> 27:17.340
All right, three more photos. Come on, guys.

346
27:17.340 --> 27:19.070
Okay. A little bit closer together.

347
27:19.070 --> 27:21.230
Turn slightly toward each other.

348
27:21.230 --> 27:24.480
One, two, three!

349
27:27.550 --> 27:29.830
How about tomorrow, then?

350
27:29.830 --> 27:32.900
Let's go celebrate. I'll invite all our friends, too.

351
27:37.580 --> 27:39.960
Well, I...

352
27:52.980 --> 27:54.940
Is it Podduang again?

353
27:54.940 --> 27:57.830
Are you really serious about him?

354
27:59.550 --> 28:02.000
You can just tell me. I'll be fine.

355
28:02.000 --> 28:03.006
Yeah.

356
28:05.780 --> 28:08.013
I'm very serious about Podduang.

357
28:10.950 --> 28:14.000
Right. That's clear enough.

358
28:19.150 --> 28:24.490
This round goes to Podduang. Risa's down 1-0.

359
28:24.490 --> 28:27.250
The queen just lost to the secret player.

360
28:34.440 --> 28:36.570
All right, let's get one more set.

361
28:36.570 --> 28:38.990
I want you to look cheerful in this one.

362
28:38.990 --> 28:41.260
Give me a big smile, please.

363
28:41.260 --> 28:44.070
You can do the finger heart. One, two, three.

364
28:44.070 --> 28:45.340
Good.

365
28:45.340 --> 28:47.860
Beautiful. One more. One, two, three.

366
28:48.800 --> 28:50.040
One more, please.

367
29:10.120 --> 29:11.553
Mr. Chanin.

368
29:34.800 --> 29:37.353
[Certificate for Jinna Ronnarak]

369
29:41.690 --> 29:43.640
I thought you weren't coming.

370
29:43.640 --> 29:44.800
I wasn't going to.

371
29:44.800 --> 29:47.720
I was going to help Bum track down that hater.

372
29:47.720 --> 29:52.040
Jeez, you were panting with your tongue out just now.

373
29:52.040 --> 29:54.710
Hey, I'm not a dog.

374
29:54.710 --> 29:56.220
Just kidding.

375
29:58.280 --> 29:59.680
Let me see.

376
30:01.840 --> 30:06.240
You're good at school and soccer.

377
30:11.400 --> 30:13.180
And you've got a smart mouth, too.

378
30:13.180 --> 30:16.928
But I think you're actually better at using your mouth.

379
30:18.224 --> 30:19.393
Come on.

380
30:20.250 --> 30:21.410
There are people around.

381
30:21.410 --> 30:23.650
Why? Did I make you blush?

382
30:25.540 --> 30:27.700
What do you mean? I'm not blushing.

383
30:30.630 --> 30:33.890
Aren't you eating with the other scholarship students?

384
30:33.890 --> 30:35.626
They're coming out now.

385
30:41.810 --> 30:43.593
I smell someone being jealous.

386
30:45.220 --> 30:47.200
I'm asking nicely. Don't get on my nerves.

387
30:47.200 --> 30:50.593
I won't eat with them. I'd rather give you a ride.

388
30:51.440 --> 30:53.160
Just a ride?

389
30:53.160 --> 30:56.494
I can go anywhere as long as it's with you.

390
31:05.400 --> 31:08.240
What are you waiting for? Aren't you coming?

391
31:09.136 --> 31:10.366
Hurry up.

392
31:24.080 --> 31:26.576
No reward for giving you a ride?

393
31:26.576 --> 31:27.926
Nope.

394
31:29.040 --> 31:32.760
It's okay. Just making you blush makes it all worth it.

395
31:33.440 --> 31:34.860
Don't be so dramatic.

396
31:35.600 --> 31:37.760
Look at those squishy cheeks.

397
31:37.760 --> 31:39.166
Stop that.

398
31:40.160 --> 31:42.386
I only do this with you, though.

399
31:43.540 --> 31:45.190
I hope that's true.

400
31:45.190 --> 31:47.110
You're the only one I'm flirting with.

401
31:50.800 --> 31:52.570
Do you realize...

402
31:53.490 --> 31:55.453
you're everyone's crush?

403
31:57.140 --> 31:58.624
I kind of know.

404
32:00.330 --> 32:02.226
And...

405
32:03.480 --> 32:06.466
Risa is so cute.

406
32:07.840 --> 32:10.066
Don't you feel anything for her?

407
32:11.950 --> 32:14.020
I already have someone I like.

408
32:16.096 --> 32:17.953
Why would I have feelings for someone else?

409
32:21.990 --> 32:25.780
Actually, I've liked him for a long time.

410
32:27.840 --> 32:30.300
I noticed him when he came to watch his friend play soccer.

411
32:31.680 --> 32:33.920
He didn't even want to talk to me at first.

412
32:33.920 --> 32:34.960
Look.

413
32:36.810 --> 32:40.624
He's always turning away just like you.

414
32:41.430 --> 32:43.210
I guess...

415
32:45.280 --> 32:47.300
he thought you were trying to upset him.

416
32:49.440 --> 32:51.153
That's why he hated your guts.

417
32:53.480 --> 32:54.893
What about now?

418
32:58.400 --> 32:59.420
Well...

419
33:04.760 --> 33:06.220
He doesn't hate you anymore.

420
33:07.420 --> 33:08.850
Really?

421
33:09.540 --> 33:12.853
Don't you think he has feelings for me, baby?

422
33:14.800 --> 33:16.320
Baby, my ass.

423
33:17.120 --> 33:19.510
Why are you being so rude, baby?

424
33:20.970 --> 33:22.313
I'm leaving now.

425
33:23.760 --> 33:26.240
I gave you a ride. Now I'm tired.

426
33:26.240 --> 33:28.189
Aren't you going to invite me to your room, baby?

427
33:30.090 --> 33:31.980
Podduang, baby.

428
33:32.910 --> 33:34.530
Podduang.

429
33:50.380 --> 33:53.770
There are rumors that you will step down from your executive position.

430
33:53.770 --> 33:55.210
Is there any truth to that?

431
33:55.210 --> 33:56.740
Rumors are just rumors.

432
33:56.740 --> 33:59.010
I have no intention of stepping down.

433
33:59.010 --> 34:01.690
And regarding Anda, the late famous series actor

434
34:01.690 --> 34:04.200
who was found dead in your condo's parking lot,

435
34:04.200 --> 34:06.450
have you been cooperating with the police investigation?

436
34:06.450 --> 34:08.520
Of course, I've been giving them my full cooperation.

437
34:08.520 --> 34:12.010
It's just unfortunate that the CCTV in that area happened to be broken.

438
34:12.010 --> 34:13.290
- But as for the evidence, - Took you so long.

439
34:13.290 --> 34:15.480
I've submitted all of it to the police.

440
34:15.480 --> 34:17.360
The CCTV shouldn't have been broken.

441
34:18.720 --> 34:21.500
I don't think it was broken.

442
34:22.784 --> 34:24.806
Someone probably sabotaged it.

443
34:32.224 --> 34:36.410
Regarding your plans to step down and let your successor take over,

444
34:36.410 --> 34:39.260
will that be happening anytime soon?

445
34:48.680 --> 34:51.420
Master still wants to talk to you, Mr. Jinna.

446
34:51.420 --> 34:55.245
He said he would agree to anything as long as you come to see him.

447
34:55.245 --> 34:57.000
Please just leave.

448
34:57.000 --> 34:58.606
I don't want to be part of this.

449
35:11.930 --> 35:14.720
The veggies are here.

450
35:16.416 --> 35:17.800
Do they look good?

451
35:17.800 --> 35:19.570
Yeah, they look amazing.

452
35:19.570 --> 35:22.980
I made four kinds of curry for you as well.

453
35:22.980 --> 35:25.490
This is your favorite, the curry with meatballs.

454
35:25.490 --> 35:28.336
You really know what I want.

455
35:28.336 --> 35:29.553
Let's eat.

456
35:30.200 --> 35:31.760
All right.

457
35:34.950 --> 35:37.630
You don't have to visit me so often.

458
35:37.630 --> 35:40.820
Why? Do you not love me anymore?

459
35:40.820 --> 35:42.170
It's not like that.

460
35:42.170 --> 35:44.600
It's just that I don't want to take up your time.

461
35:44.600 --> 35:47.120
Come on, what do you mean by that?

462
35:47.120 --> 35:49.919
Look, I have something to show you.

463
35:53.110 --> 35:54.446
What is this?

464
35:57.880 --> 35:59.195
Listen, Auntie. [Jinna Ronnarak, Top Scholar]

465
35:59.195 --> 36:02.600
I just want some free food. It's not like I missed you.

466
36:02.600 --> 36:04.520
You're amazing.

467
36:05.210 --> 36:08.192
Well, are you lonely, though?

468
36:08.192 --> 36:09.550
Come on!

469
36:09.550 --> 36:11.526
I'm not lonely at all.

470
36:12.910 --> 36:15.100
Maew and Nuan,

471
36:15.100 --> 36:18.510
my friends, ask me to play mahjong with them every day.

472
36:18.510 --> 36:20.500
It's good that you've got some friends.

473
36:21.920 --> 36:23.690
What about you? Are you lonely?

474
36:23.690 --> 36:26.046
How come you're still not dating anyone?

475
36:29.450 --> 36:31.580
Breaking business news today:

476
36:31.580 --> 36:33.430
The illness of Chanin,

477
36:33.430 --> 36:36.490
the famous real estate mogul of Thailand,

478
36:36.490 --> 36:39.110
has worsened for unknown reasons.

479
36:45.440 --> 36:47.653
Does he still try to contact you?

480
36:48.620 --> 36:51.973
I don't know, and I don't want to know, either.

481
36:53.320 --> 36:57.590
Jinna, it's been a long time since that happened.

482
36:58.280 --> 37:00.100
The longer, the better.

483
37:00.100 --> 37:03.360
Right now, you're more than enough for me.

484
37:03.360 --> 37:06.313
But your dad probably needs you.

485
37:07.330 --> 37:11.470
And that lawyer has come here many times, too.

486
37:11.470 --> 37:16.573
Does he want me or someone to take over his business?

487
37:19.280 --> 37:21.655
Come on, don't make that face.

488
37:21.655 --> 37:23.720
You're supposed to take my side.

489
37:23.720 --> 37:25.270
Yeah.

490
37:25.270 --> 37:28.066
I'm always taking your side.

491
37:30.000 --> 37:31.540
Come on.

492
37:31.540 --> 37:33.870
- Let's eat. - Sure.

493
37:33.870 --> 37:37.690
Now, which curry do you want? Let me get you some first.

494
37:37.690 --> 37:40.180
I want this. Give me the veggies first.

495
37:42.160 --> 37:43.826
Eating healthy?

496
37:47.440 --> 37:48.853
Good.

497
37:51.120 --> 37:54.320
Seriously, would you go this far if it were for me?

498
37:55.040 --> 37:56.399
What kind of question is that?

499
38:05.680 --> 38:07.600
Babe. Look.

500
38:07.600 --> 38:11.070
He never posted but now that he's dating our friend,

501
38:11.070 --> 38:12.890
he's suddenly taking selfies.

502
38:12.890 --> 38:14.240
Look at this.

503
38:14.240 --> 38:16.313
You can't even read the certificate.

504
38:18.880 --> 38:19.919
See?

505
38:27.600 --> 38:28.713
Take this.

506
38:29.920 --> 38:31.260
What, babe?

507
38:33.360 --> 38:34.793
You'll take a photo?

508
38:34.793 --> 38:35.826
All right.

509
38:37.250 --> 38:38.800
Hey, you're blocking it.

510
38:38.800 --> 38:40.133
Blocking what?

511
38:43.240 --> 38:44.600
What are you doing?

512
38:58.960 --> 39:00.809
Amp!

513
39:00.809 --> 39:02.200
Sir!

514
39:02.200 --> 39:04.086
- Help! - Coming!

515
39:05.520 --> 39:07.560
- Can you walk? - Yes.

516
39:15.090 --> 39:17.460
[I'm taking Amp to the hospital.]

517
39:22.770 --> 39:24.079
"AM..."

518
39:24.640 --> 39:26.953
Am? Who's that?

519
39:30.860 --> 39:32.353
Take a deep breath.

520
39:34.000 --> 39:37.190
Relatives aren't allowed inside. Please step out.

521
39:37.190 --> 39:38.970
Sir, are you a relative?

522
39:38.970 --> 39:42.240
No, I'm not. I'm just her neighbor.

523
39:42.240 --> 39:44.520
Do you have any of her personal information?

524
39:49.510 --> 39:51.472
Is her ID card okay?

525
39:51.472 --> 39:52.999
Thank you very much.

526
39:56.450 --> 39:59.540
Podduang once told me about his neighbor named Amp.

527
39:59.540 --> 40:01.550
She's an Anda fan, too.

528
40:02.920 --> 40:04.660
It's definitely her.

529
40:08.490 --> 40:10.200
I can't wait any longer.

530
40:10.200 --> 40:12.213
You keep trying to reach Podduang.

531
40:13.060 --> 40:14.580
Why isn't he picking up?

532
40:17.310 --> 40:20.720
[Anda's hater face reveal! Could this be the killer? #JusticeForAnda]

533
40:20.720 --> 40:24.173
[Emergency]

534
40:38.420 --> 40:39.913
What about my baby?

535
40:42.200 --> 40:43.733
Where's the doctor?

536
40:48.390 --> 40:51.106
The nurse said the baby is safe.

537
41:02.200 --> 41:04.293
Thank you, Podduang.

538
41:07.790 --> 41:10.330
I'm really sorry, Amp.

539
41:10.330 --> 41:14.553
I hope you don't mind that I gave your ID to the nurse.

540
41:17.550 --> 41:19.059
It's okay.

541
41:21.030 --> 41:22.533
You should rest.

542
41:23.160 --> 41:26.230
You can call me anytime if you need anything.

543
42:18.010 --> 42:22.580
[Nurses' Station]

544
42:35.090 --> 42:38.333
[10 missed calls from Dunk]

545
42:40.120 --> 42:41.200
Breaking news, everyone.

546
42:41.200 --> 42:45.120
An account called "Andaman TH" was created by one of the fans of the late actor Anda,

547
42:45.120 --> 42:49.270
whose death was ruled a suicide by authorities.

548
42:49.270 --> 42:53.520
The account has revealed the identity of this Anda's hater.

549
42:53.520 --> 42:56.160
- However, we have to blur her face for now - Right.

550
42:56.160 --> 42:58.710
because we haven't yet verified the information.

551
42:58.710 --> 43:02.920
Anyway, we know this hater once sent Anda

552
43:02.920 --> 43:05.193
a bloodstained doll. [Go to hell already!]

553
43:13.280 --> 43:15.300
[The Chemistry is Real! Fans Show Up in Force to Welcome Them on Day One]

554
43:41.080 --> 43:44.560
Furthermore, Andaman TH also revealed

555
43:44.560 --> 43:49.060
that this woman had looked into Anda's family background.

556
43:49.060 --> 43:54.390
Right, haters are terrifying these days, especially on social media.

557
43:54.390 --> 43:57.513
We'll have to see how the truth unfolds. [The face reveal of Amp, the suspect.]

558
44:13.090 --> 44:15.919
Things seem to be spiraling out of control now.

559
44:17.850 --> 44:24.059
The hater behind that account also seems to have a motive to commit the crime.

560
44:26.380 --> 44:29.200
It looks like she really hated your brother.

561
44:29.200 --> 44:31.879
She knew practically everything about him.

562
44:33.080 --> 44:36.660
And now she's disappeared, which makes it even more suspicious.

563
44:38.440 --> 44:42.160
I heard she even dug into your family.

564
44:42.160 --> 44:46.064
I'm not sure how your parents are doing.

565
44:46.064 --> 44:49.779
If you haven't done anything wrong, you won't need to run away.

566
45:05.984 --> 45:07.320
Amp?

567
45:08.050 --> 45:09.326
Who are you?

568
45:10.520 --> 45:12.680
[Card Registration - Medical Records]

569
45:24.600 --> 45:25.700
Jinna...

570
45:32.960 --> 45:34.120
I...

571
45:35.280 --> 45:37.254
I've figured out who killed Anda.

572
45:41.880 --> 45:43.790
If Anda was really murdered,

573
45:43.790 --> 45:47.616
then I will bring the killer to justice myself.

574
45:58.210 --> 46:01.070
That Amp next door is dangerous to you anyway.

575
46:01.070 --> 46:02.880
You shouldn't be here for now.

576
46:02.880 --> 46:07.126
How long have you known Amp, your next-door neighbor?

577
46:08.080 --> 46:10.480
I'm taking my pants off now.

578
46:10.480 --> 46:12.920
Dammit, Jinna!

579
46:12.920 --> 46:17.313
Next time, let me be the one to choose the movie.

580
46:18.880 --> 46:19.570
[Don't get involved in Anda's case if you still want to live.]

581
46:19.570 --> 46:21.760
How do they know you?

582
46:21.760 --> 46:24.560
Anda, we're so close to figuring out the truth.

583
46:24.560 --> 46:26.733
2807.

584
46:27.360 --> 46:28.680
At home.

585
46:28.680 --> 46:29.700
The bedroom.

586
46:29.700 --> 46:31.280
Anda told me, Mom.

587
46:31.280 --> 46:33.460
Don't talk such nonsense.

588
46:33.460 --> 46:34.940
2807.

589
46:34.940 --> 46:37.170
Isn't that our birthdays, honey?

590
46:37.170 --> 46:40.350
I already told you to leave me and Auntie Amphon alone.

591
46:40.350 --> 46:43.386
Master really wants to talk to you, Mr. Jinna.
